ys the completed handover and its original time\",\n     \"when\": \"the new route is synchronized\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an assigned route changes while a driver is offline, the Meridian web app shall show route differences, require review and resolution of affected unsent work before continuing, and preserve completed offline handovers.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-13\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"ASM-9\",\n    \"I-8\",\n    \"I-14\",\n    \"I-16\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An offline handover is synchronized and the service returns a hold or recall conflict and quality-case result\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-14.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen displays the retained handover, conflict flag, and returned quality-case status\",\n     \"when\": \"the driver or quality user opens the synchronized record\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When an offline handover conflicts with a hold or recall upon synchronization, the Meridian web app shall retain and flag the handover and display the returned quality-case result.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-14\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"ASM-10\",\n    \"I-14\",\n    \"I-16\",\n    \"I-41\",\n    \"I-46\",\n    \"I-47\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"An excursion review receives temperature history, tier budgets, and a recommendation\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-15.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen displays the full history, used and remaining allowance for each tier, and the recommendation\",\n     \"when\": \"a Quality reviewer opens the affected handling unit\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"Configured tier limits and allowances are returned for different products\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-REQ-15.2\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"the screen displays the same configured tier-limit and allowance values for each produc